{61}{Well, I don't know what this place used to be, but ever since ol' Tom Handy built the tavern, a couple times a year all the wandering merchants pile in here for a bit of a gather, then folks from all around just seem to find their way here in time for it.}{Well, I don't know what this place used to be, but ever since ol' Tom Handy built the tavern, a couple times a year all the wandering merchants pile in here for a bit of a gather, then folks from all around just seem to find their way here in time for it.}{}{}{}{}
