{67}{[He scratches his temple] If it's adventure you want, go pick a fight with someone, or try stealing something. I promise you'll have all the adventure you'll ever want. We have one rule here - If you're not buying, keep your hands and opinions to yourself. Understand?}{[He scratches his temple] If it's adventure you want, go pick a fight with someone, or try stealing something. I promise you'll have all the adventure you'll ever want. We have one rule here - If you're not buying, keep your hands and opinions to yourself. Understand?}{}{}{}{}
